      ],
      "text": "MCP servers are configured in ~/.jcode/mcp.json (global) and .jcode/mcp.json (project-local); Claude Code config files (~/.claude.json, .mcp.json, .claude/mcp.json) are read live, and a one-time import from ~/.codex/config.toml is performed."
    },
    {
