      "text": "The README reports self-measured benchmarks: jcode at 14.0 ms time-to-first-frame and 48.7 ms time-to-first-input versus slower figures for Codex CLI, Claude Code, OpenCode, Cursor Agent, and others, across 10 interactive PTY launches on one Linux machine."
    },
