      ],
      "text": "A memory-scaling comparison reports ~9.9-10.4 MB extra PSS per added jcode session versus larger figures for competing tools, with tested versions listed (e.g. jcode v0.9.1888-dev, codex-cli 0.120.0, Claude Code 2.1.86)."
    },
